[\fB\-camellia192\fR]
[\fB\-camellia256\fR]
[\fB\-des\fR]
[\fB\-des3\fR]
[\fB\-idea\fR]
[\fB\-noenc\fR]
[\fB\-nodes\fR]
.PP
گزینه‌های خروجی (صدور) PKCS#12:
.PP
[\fB\-export\fR]
[\fB\-inkey\fR \fIfilename\fR|\fIuri\fR]
[\fB\-certfile\fR \fIfilename\fR]
[\fB\-passcerts\fR \fIarg\fR]
[\fB\-chain\fR]
[\fB\-untrusted\fR \fIfilename\fR]
[\fB\-CAfile\fR \fIfile\fR]
[\fB\-no\-CAfile\fR]
